---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  description={`I'm a software engineer in Kamra, Pakistan. Currently at XTEL, previously Tasq and BriteCore. I write about backend work and things learned along the way.`}
  canonicalPath="/"
>
  <section class="section-about">
    <h1 class="heading-2 heading-2--dark mb-md">About</h1>

    <p class="text text--lead mb-lg">
      Software engineer in Kamra, Pakistan. Full stack, though I spend more time on the backend.
      I care about making complicated systems behave in ways you can actually understand.
    </p>

    <p class="text">
      These days I'm at XTEL, on promotion and pricing tools for consumer goods companies. Before
      that: Tasq, BriteCore, and co-founding <strong>Chef Galaxy</strong>, a chef marketplace I
      built end to end that didn't last, but taught me a lot. Longer versions are on <a href="/projects">Work</a> and the <a href="/blog">blog</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="text">
      At home I'm with my wife <b>Yusaira</b> and our sons <b>Azlan</b> and <b>Zaman</b>. I keep an
      aviary of <a href="https://lafeber.com/pet-birds/species/cockatiel/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">cockatiels</a> and <a href="https://lafeber.com/pet-birds/species/budgie-parakeet/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">budgies</a>, and I studied Software Engineering at the <a href="https://giki.edu.pk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GIK Institute</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="text">
      Say hello at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
